#. module: account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro.field_res_company__bypass_journal_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro.field_res_config_settings__bypass_journal_ids
msgid "Journals that bypass authorization"
msgstr "Diarios que esquivan la autorización"

#. module: account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro.field_res_company__bypass_journal_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro.field_res_config_settings__bypass_journal_ids
msgid ""
"Only journals that can be chosen as the pay now journal of a vendor bill. A "
"vendor bill paid on confirmation with one of them does not require "
"authorization, unless an 'Always block' policy matches it. Leave empty to "
"keep the pay now journal working as before, with no bypass."
msgstr ""
"Únicos diarios que se pueden elegir como diario de pago directo de una "
"factura de proveedor. Una factura de proveedor pagada al confirmarse con uno"
" de ellos no requiere autorización, salvo que coincida con una política con "
"'Bloquear siempre'. Déjelo vacío para que el diario de pago directo siga "
"funcionando como antes, sin excepción."

#. module: account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro.field_res_company__bypass_user_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro.field_res_config_settings__bypass_user_ids
msgid ""
"Only these users can set a pay now journal on a vendor bill, or confirm a "
"vendor bill that has one, while journals that bypass authorization are "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Mientras haya diarios que esquivan la autorización configurados, solo estos "
"usuarios pueden establecer un diario de pago directo en una factura de "
"proveedor, o confirmar una factura de proveedor que lo tenga."

#. module: account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro
#: model:ir.model,name:account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro.model_account_payment
msgid "Payments"
msgstr "Pagos"

#. module: account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The pay now journal %(journal)s of vendor bill %(bill)s is not one of the "
"journals that bypass authorization."
msgstr ""
"El diario de pago directo %(journal)s de la factura de proveedor %(bill)s no"
" es uno de los diarios que esquivan la autorización."

#. module: account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro.field_res_company__bypass_user_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro.field_res_config_settings__bypass_user_ids
msgid "Users allowed to use this bypass"
msgstr "Usuarios habilitados para esquivar la autorización"

#. module: account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Vendor bill authorization bypass"
msgstr "Excepción a la autorización de facturas de proveedor"

#. module: account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Vendor bills paid on confirmation with one of these journals don't require "
"authorization, unless an 'Always block' policy matches them. Only these "
"users can set the pay now journal on a vendor bill or confirm one that has "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas de proveedor pagadas al confirmarse con uno de estos diarios no"
" requieren autorización, salvo que coincidan con una política con 'Bloquear "
"siempre'. Solo estos usuarios pueden establecer el diario de pago directo en"
" una factura de proveedor o confirmar una que lo tenga."

#. module: account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_vendor_bill_authorization_pro/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"You are not allowed to use the pay now journal %(journal)s on vendor bill "
"%(bill)s: only the users allowed to bypass vendor bill authorization can set"
" a pay now journal or confirm a vendor bill that has one."
msgstr ""
"No tiene permitido usar el diario de pago directo %(journal)s en la factura "
"de proveedor %(bill)s: solo los usuarios habilitados para esquivar la "
"autorización de facturas de proveedor pueden establecer un diario de pago "
"directo o confirmar una factura de proveedor que lo tenga."
